      ],
      "content": "SP 90 NE; 3/250 NORTHCHURCH, HIGH STREET (south side), No. 127 (Exhims) 09.05.73. II Brown brick, red brick dressings.  Hipped Welsh slated roof.  Two storeys and attics, five sashes with glazing bars under flat arches, flush set frames, narrow proportions closely spaced.  Coved cornice, two casement box dormers. This asset was previously listed twice. The duplicate record (List entry number 1078105) was removed from the List on 11 January 2019. Listing NGR: SP9743108735"
    }
